# ---- 实验数据 / 结果（只留代码和文档）----
# offline_experiments：提交 scripts/tests/config/dashboard/examples 与 md，其余是数据
offline_experiments/results/
offline_experiments/data/
offline_experiments/campaigns/
offline_experiments/diagnostics/
offline_experiments/runtime/
offline_experiments/matrix/
offline_experiments/*_staging/
offline_experiments/frozen_vl_staging/
offline_experiments/qwen35_vl_staging/
offline_experiments/glm_seed_tokenizer_20260811/

# artifacts：默认全忽略，只白名单放行「冻结参数 / 冻结预测 / 发布产物」
# 原始观测（canonical_*.jsonl 约 1.9GB）、历史 recovery 快照、.bak 备份都不进库
offline_experiments/artifacts/*
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*frozen*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*frozen*.md
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*_release_*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*_peak_v*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*safety_upper*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*model_inventory*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/*candidate_predictions*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/model_inventory.json
# 4090 预测器：冻结系数 JSON 属于发布产物，必须进库
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_*_predictor.json
# 双卡联合显存模型的完整拟合+验证报告：它是「为什么选这套系数」的唯一完整记录
# （40 个候选对比、跨卡外推、留模型验证、乘子重标定全过程）。打包进
# server_integration 的是精简版，不含验证细节，丢了这份就无法复核。
!offline_experiments/artifacts/joint_card_v3_memory_v*.json

# H800 VL/Hybrid 三件套：交付给下游做超参推荐开发的模型产物。
# 合计约 1.2MB。建模表体积最大（约 1.1MB），但下游若要复拟或核对支持域必须有它。
!offline_experiments/artifacts/h800_vl_memory_table_v1.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/h800_vl_admission_v2.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/h800_vl_memory_center_v*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/h800_vl_throughput_center_v*.json
!offline_experiments/artifacts/h800_vl_extrapolation_verdict_v*.json
# 白名单里也要排掉体积过大的观测类文件
offline_experiments/artifacts/*observations*
offline_experiments/artifacts/*recovery*
offline_experiments/artifacts/*.bak-*
# 4090 观测数据是例外：全部 jsonl 合计 355KB，且是 4090 预测器唯一的
# 可复算依据（拟合脚本直接读它们）。不进库的话别人 clone 下来无法复算。
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_vl_observations_20260823/
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_vl_observations_20260823/*.jsonl
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_qwen35_observations_20260825/
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_qwen35_observations_20260825/*.jsonl
!offline_experiments/artifacts/rtx4090_qwen35_observations_20260825/*.py
# 但备份文件仍然不进库
offline_experiments/artifacts/**/*.bak_before_*

# blind_data：只提交构建脚本与数据画像摘要，图片与数据集本体不进库
offline_experiments/blind_data/vl/
offline_experiments/blind_data/**/*.jsonl

# mfu：只提交 configs/scripts
mfu_qwen3_8b/results/
mfu_qwen3_14b/results/

# real_business_validation：大体积数据不推，代码与小结提交
real_business_validation_20260730/datasets/
real_business_validation_20260730/recommendations/

# 历史实验快照（整体不推）
offline_experiments_genrun/
offline_experiments_qgen_20260729/
offline_experiments_qwen35_tilelang_20260729/
single_gpu_mbs_ab_20260730/
qwen35_tilelang_overlay_20260729/

